ございますのでご注意ください。```\n`\u003chttp://xn--t8jx73hngb.com|お名前.com\u003e` のメールですが、こういうの来ますね","ts":"1617266344.170800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tDe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4438f03b-d521-4219-a368-1ea4e9602991","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"しょうみ最近のドメインレジストラって whois 代替って無料でしょ？","ts":"1617266253.170300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VDm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a27a732-03ad-4025-a1bb-700cf24e936a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(ただしうろおぼえ)","ts":"1617266064.169900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ffJ="}]},{"client_msg_id":"eee0b3a5-58d6-4a7c-a3c4-d5d85fd9f0d6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最新情報の確認(変更なかったらそのままOK押す)とかの依頼メール見落しとかだろうか?\nで、期限が切れて凍結とか...whois(というか管理自体というかが)厳しくなったみたな話しもそこそこ前にあった気がするし","ts":"1617266051.169700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jys/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CBA2E23E-03AD-4CFE-8AA8-119119CB6FF8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"どういうことなんでしょうねぇ","ts":"1617266028.169200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"umh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50977d22-5ad8-416d-aa36-ea0d70aeab34","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"whois 代替かなにかが有料になってそのメールを見逃したとか？","ts":"1617265980.168100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rmgM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0CFD10E0-0437-4C2B-9324-81161E6258AF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"支払いに関しては自動更新があるレジストラで管理するのが良さそうですね。","ts":"1617265952.167600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oM5="}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f0d3def-3928-414e-b7a2-960abe4f17d5","type":"m